-- ONE OF can be the whole type of a field, but not part of one: not after
-- MAYBE either (specs/proposals/INLINE-ONE-OF-FIELD-SPEC.md §5.1, second row).
-- MAYBE takes its argument optionally, so the ONE is met after the type;
-- the message is the same.
DECLARE Plot HAS
    `the occupier` IS A STRING
    `tenure`       IS A MAYBE ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
